    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Honesty",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Instruments from `apps/gateway/src/telemetry/metrics.ts`.\n\n**Emitted but not on this dashboard yet:** `wispr_memory_staleness_hours`, `wispr_drift_open_total` (see `infra/grafana/README.md`).\n\n**Not a runtime series:** `wispr_speech_to_reticle_ms`.\n\n`wispr_false_execution_total` is registered and has **no production `.add()`**. A flat zero is not a clean bill of health.\n\n`wispr_tier_total` and `wispr_seed_plan_latency_ms` are also recorded by the composer. Queries filter `service_name=\"wispr-gateway\"`."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP requests",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (route, status_class) (rate(wispr_gateway_requests_total{service_name=\"wispr-gateway\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}} {{status_class}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP duration p95 (budget: none stated for HTTP; seed preview is 1.2s)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, route) (rate(wispr_gateway_request_duration_ms_bucket{service_name=\"wispr-gateway\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms" }, "overrides": [] }
